# 6️⃣ Docker Volumes 💾

Volumes are used for **persistent data**.

```bash
docker volume ls
docker volume create app-data
docker volume inspect app-data
```

### Mount Volume

```bash
docker run -d -v app-data:/data IMAGE
```

**Common uses:**

* Databases
* Uploaded files
* Application data

---

# 7️⃣ Docker Networking 🌐

Networking allows containers to communicate.

```bash
docker network ls
docker network create app-network
docker network inspect app-network
```

### Example

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name backend \
  --network app-network \
  backend-image
```

```text
Frontend
   ↓
Docker Network
   ↓
Backend
   ↓
Database
```

